---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Free resources — Approaching Infinity" description="Put your next three bills on one page with a free, private bill-calendar worksheet.">
<section class="page-shell resource-page">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="page-heading">
<h1>One useful step.</h1>
<p>Free resources you can use right now. Start small, keep your details private and take one idea into your week.</p>
</div>
<article class="resource-card resource-feature">
<div class="resource-copy">
<p class="resource-status">Financial literacy · Free · No signup</p>
<h2>Put your next three bills on one page</h2>
<p>Write down three bills, see your planned payment dates and choose one thing to check next. Fill it in here or print a copy for paper.</p>
<a class="btn btn-red" href="/resources/bill-calendar-worksheet/">Start the worksheet</a>
<div class="resource-options">
<a class="text-link" href="/resources/bill-calendar-worksheet/#example">Try the example</a>
<a class="text-link" href="/resources/bill-calendar-worksheet/#print">Print a blank copy</a>
<a class="text-link" href="/resources/month-ahead/">Read the walkthrough</a>
</div>
</div>
<a class="worksheet-visual" href="/resources/bill-calendar-worksheet/" aria-label="Open the free bill-calendar worksheet">
<span class="visual-kicker">YOUR NEXT THREE BILLS</span>
<span class="visual-row">
<span>01 · Phone</span>
<span>Due by</span>
<span>Pay on</span>
</span>
<span class="visual-row">
<span>02 · Electricity</span>
<span>—</span>
<span>—</span>
</span>
<span class="visual-row">
<span>03 · Internet</span>
<span>—</span>
<span>—</span>
</span>
<span class="visual-calendar" aria-hidden="true">{Array.from({length:14},(_,i)=>
<span class:list={{marked:[2,6,10].includes(i)}}>{i+1}</span>)}</span>
<span class="visual-footer">One month. One next step. <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
</span>
</a>
</article>
<p class="resource-later">Veteran initiatives and ending poverty resources are still in preparation. <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Suggest a useful question.</a>
</p>
</div>
</section>
</Layout>
<style>.resource-page{padding-top:100px}.resource-page .page-heading{margin-bottom:2rem}.resource-page .page-heading h1{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,4vw,3.5rem)}.resource-feature{max-width:none;width:100%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr 1fr;gap:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,4rem);align-items:center;padding:clamp(1.4rem,4vw,3rem)}.resource-copy h2{font-size:clamp(2.1rem,4vw,3.6rem);max-width:18ch}.resource-copy>p{margin-block:1rem 1.4rem}.resource-options{display:flex;gap:.8rem 1.3rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1.4rem;font-size:.9rem}.worksheet-visual{display:block;background:#f6f3f1;color:#171412;padding:1.5rem;transform:rotate(1deg);border-top:5px solid var(--red);box-shadow:0 15px 30px #0005}.worksheet-visual:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--red-hot);outline-offset:8px}.visual-kicker{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.12em;display:block;margin-bottom:1.3rem}.visual-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr;font-size:.75rem;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;gap:.4rem;padding:.7rem 0}.visual-calendar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:3px;margin:1.3rem 0}.visual-calendar>span{border:1px solid #d0ccca;min-height:32px;font-size:.65rem;padding:.2rem}.visual-calendar .marked{background:#e31b23;color:#fff;border-color:#e31b23}.visual-footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-weight:600;font-size:.85rem}.resource-later{margin-top:2rem;max-width:75ch;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}.resource-later a{text-decoration:underline}@media(max-width:750px){.resource-feature{grid-template-columns:1fr}.worksheet-visual{max-width:440px;transform:none}.resource-options{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}}</style>
